### POST category
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Fruits",
    "description": "Fruits category",
    "order": 200
}

### PATCH category
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/category/23
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Fruits 2",
    "description": "Fruits category 2",
    "order": 2000
}

